Moved PulpBot from the decommissioned Splunk to Sumo Logic: the entrypoint exports `SUMO_API_URL`, `SUMO_ACCESS_ID` and `SUMO_ACCESS_KEY` from the `agent-pulpbot` Secret instead of `SPLUNK_TOKEN`, a new credential-holding `sumo-search` helper runs Search Job API queries, `secret-guard` now treats `*ACCESS_KEY*` variables as secrets, and the charter points PulpBot at Sumo Logic for logs.
